          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif; border-bottom:3px solid #1e3a8a; padding-bottom:16px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='font-size:32px; font-weight:900; color:#1e3a8a; letter-spacing:1.5px; line-height:1.1;'>CLAIRE HENDERSON, M.ED.</div><div style='font-size:12.5px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:2.5px; color:#f59e0b; margin-top:8px; background:#1e3a8a; display:inline-block; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:4px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'>UPPER SCHOOL AP LITERATURE & CURRICULUM CHAIR</div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 4,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "295.0px",
          "top": "205.0px",
          "width": "465.0px",
          "height": "115.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif; background:#f8fafc; border-left:4px solid #1e3a8a; padding:14px 18px; border-radius:0 6px 6px 0; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='font-size:11px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:2px; color:#1e3a8a; margin-bottom:6px;'>EXECUTIVE PROFILE</div><div style='font-size:12px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55;'>Results-driven leader with 9+ years of specialized experience delivering high-impact initiatives, mentoring top-performing teams, and driving measurable operational excellence across fast-paced environments.</div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 5,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
        },
        {
          "left": "295.0px",
          "top": "342.0px",
          "width": "465.0px",
          "height": "530.0px",
          "innerHTML": "<div contenteditable='true' spellcheck='false' style='font-family:sans-serif;'><div style='font-size:13px; font-weight:900; letter-spacing:2.5px; color:#1e3a8a; border-bottom:2px solid #e2e8f0; padding-bottom:6px; margin-bottom:18px;'>PROFESSIONAL EXPERIENCE</div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #f59e0b; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Humanities Department Chair & AP Literature Teacher — Lincoln Prep</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#1e3a8a; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2020 - PRESENT</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Mentored 18 faculty members and achieved a 96% pass rate (4.4 avg score) on AP English Literature exams across 140 seniors.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #f59e0b; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Lead English & Debate Instructor — Lakeside Academy</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#1e3a8a; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2017 - 2020</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Designed interdisciplinary project-based humanities curriculum and coached Varsity Debate to two State Championships.</div></div><div style='margin-bottom:20px; border-left:3px solid #f59e0b; padding-left:14px; -webkit-print-color-adjust:exact; print-color-adjust:exact;'><div style='display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline;'><span style='font-size:14px; font-weight:900; color:#0f172a;'>Literacy Intervention Specialist — Seattle Public Schools</span><span style='font-size:10.5px; font-weight:800; color:#1e3a8a; background:#f1f5f9; padding:3px 8px; border-radius:4px;'>2015 - 2017</span></div><div style='font-size:12.2px; color:#334155; line-height:1.55; margin-top:6px;'>Spearheaded reading comprehension workshops raising 9th-grade literacy proficiency scores by 31 percentile points.</div></div></div>",
          "transform": "none",
          "zIndex": 6,
          "scaleX": "1",
          "scaleY": "1"
